# pm51stack workflow

`/pm51-mode` is the controller for non-trivial engineering work. Read `skills/pm51-mode/SKILL.md` inside this plugin and follow it. Project rules and the forge (GitHub or GitLab) come from `.cursor/rules/pm51stack.mdc`. When that file is missing, ask the user.

`/pm51-help` answers which playbook fits and stops there. It does not start the task.

Upstream skill text stays in the repositories `setup-pm51stack` installs, and in the pstack plugin. This rule routes to those skills. It does not replace them.
